    "initial_matrix": "One pair per condition, alternating baseline/candidate order. Unchanged original peers: full 400,021,888-byte mild workload with diagnostic timeout 180s. Instrumented peers: clean/delay/jitter/loss controls, mild 1/8/32-stream workloads with 3s offered duration and 60s timeout; final full workload in reverse order with 180s timeout.",
