    {
      "status": "mechanism reproduced; full causal scope remains under investigation",
      "finding": "Early NAKs appear while reported RTT is still the startup 100ms value, with packet intervals already about 7\u201342ms. Synthetic controller inputs with sparse first-ACK feedback produce a 103ms interval after loss and about 12ms after ten seconds of subsequent synthetic feedback. FileRateController source and probe outputs are identical across versions.",
